{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":7,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"當我要醫治以色列的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮的罪就顯露出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒瑪利亞","poem":1},{"noteId":13},{"text":"的惡就暴露出來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們行事詭詐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盜賊進屋偷竊，強盜外出搶劫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沒有想到我記得他們的所有惡行。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如今他們的罪惡環繞他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"都暴露在我面前。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們以罪惡取悅君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以謊言討好首領。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都是通姦之徒","poem":1},{"noteId":14},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像燃燒的火爐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從揉麵到麵團發起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烤餅的人不用挑旺爐火。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王宴樂的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"首領們醉酒成病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王也與輕慢上帝的人聯手。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的心如火爐，醞釀著陰謀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的怒氣整夜冒煙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨爆發出熊熊烈焰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們都像炙熱的火爐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞滅他們的首領。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的君王都倒地而亡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沒有一個向我求救。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"「以法蓮與外族人混雜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像沒有翻過的餅","poem":1},{"noteId":15},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外族人耗盡了他的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他卻茫然不知。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他頭髮斑白，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻渾然不覺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人被自己的傲慢指控，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻不歸向他們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不去尋求祂。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮像鴿子一樣愚蠢無知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們向埃及求救，又投奔亞述。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們去的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要張網網住他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像打落飛鳥一樣打落他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要按他們的惡行","poem":1},{"noteId":16},{"text":"懲罰他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們有禍了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們背棄我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要被毀滅了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們背叛我！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要救贖他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻向我撒謊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們沒有真心呼求我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只是在床上哭號。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們為求五穀和新酒而割傷自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻背棄了我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我訓練他們，使他們臂膀強壯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們卻陰謀作惡抗拒我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們回轉，卻不肯轉向至高者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就像無用的弓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的首領要因出言狂妄而喪身刀下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在埃及成為人們的笑柄。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":13,"caller":"+","text":"「撒瑪利亞」為北國以色列的首都，此處代指以色列。本卷書中下同。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":1}},{"noteId":14,"caller":"+","text":"「通姦之徒」此處指以色列人背棄耶和華，祭拜偶像。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":4}},{"noteId":15,"caller":"+","text":"「沒有翻過的餅」指一面烤焦一面生的餅，不能食用，意義見下節。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":8}},{"noteId":16,"caller":"+","text":"「他們的惡行」希伯來文是「他們的會眾所聽到的」。","reference":{"chapter":7,"verse":12}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/7.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/8.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/6.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}